                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "q0uta",
                  "name": "Comp — Composer shell",
                  "context": "Search all available Tabra data the user is permitted to access. References and mentions add context, not corpus filters. + opens the reference library; @ inserts linked people or committees, without notifying them. Never auto-send after selection. Desktop Enter sends except during IME composition; Shift+Enter inserts a line. Mobile Return inserts a line. No visible keyboard shortcut hint. Draft grows to six lines, then scrolls. Send and Stop are fixed 44 by 44 circles. AI Elements mapping: PromptInput with controlled provider state, reference Header, Textarea Body, Footer Tools and Submit. In DOM, place InputGroup addons after the textarea and position visually with align. Preserve text and reference snapshots through submitted, streaming, error, stop and unknown outcomes. Do not copy automatic reset or file-upload handlers from library examples.",
                  "reusable": true,
                  "clip": true,
                  "width": 620,
                  "fill": "#00000000",
                  "stroke": "$line-strong",
                  "strokeAlignment": "inner",
                  "layout": "vertical",
