                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": 1180,
                      "content": "Colour is the only layer we theme, and only because the brand requires it. Type, radius and spacing are shadcn defaults with zero overrides. Before adding a customisation, check that the need is real and that shadcn cannot express it; a token that exists only to be slightly different is a maintenance cost with no user-visible benefit.",
