          "id": "puvag",
          "name": "Desc",
          "fill": "$ink-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Current bill ingestion stores source text and sections, not structured commencement dates or conditions. Show the enactment action and link to the enacted text. A missing extracted date does not mean the law has no effective date. Future date extraction requires a pinned version, source passage, section scope, and review of conditions; do not calculate a date from enactment alone.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": "$text-xs",
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
