                                              "content": "Amended text, quoted without change"
                                            },
                                            "WzmNa": {
                                              "content": "(a)  A local educational agency that uses an artificial intelligence system to evaluate student work shall publish a policy describing that use and shall notify a parent before the system processes the work of that student.",
