              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Setup resumes without duplicates. Invitations are optional. Viewer actions never write. Drafts stay in their original workspace. Conflicts never overwrite silently. Revoked content is not recoverable through this UI. Billing changes need verified provider outcomes and approved terms.",
