              "fill": "$ink-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Keyboard contract: labeled fields, inline errors linked to their field, pending actions prevent repeat submission. Escape returns to the invoking control; guarded transitions announce the active workspace. Conflict and access-denied states announce their heading. Keep visible focus on every action. Mobile hit targets are at least 44 px.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
