                  "name": "Tenure-scoped paged personal votes / wyvM7",
                  "context": "Tenure-scoped paged personal votes Inputs: entityId, query, scope, dateFilter, sort/group, page/cursor, knownTotal, rows, returnState. Variants and snapshots: desktop/narrow, initial/continued month, all/current/historical scope, large result set, search/filter intersection.",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "wyvM7",
                      "name": "Tenure-scoped paged personal votes",
                      "context": "Representative Votes at scale. Scope is office tenure, then legislative period, then vote date. Sort is vote date, newest first, grouped by Month Year with the full date on every row. Search and filters apply to the whole filtered list before paging; twenty votes a page. A published position is shown exactly as the source gives it; Unknown means no position was published and is never shown as No or as an abstention.\nComponent contract: Tenure-scoped paged personal votes Inputs: entityId, query, scope, dateFilter, sort/group, page/cursor, knownTotal, rows, returnState. Variants and snapshot states: desktop/narrow, initial/continued month, all/current/historical scope, large result set, search/filter intersection. Preserve source IDs, exact copy, unknowns, versions, navigation and focus semantics. Static design boundary, not executable tests.",
                      "reusable": true,
                      "width": 1128,
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": "$space-2",
                      "padding": [
                        "$space-2",
                        0,
                        0,
