                  "context": "Tenure-scoped paged personal votes Inputs: entityId, query, scope, dateFilter, sort/group, page/cursor, knownTotal, rows, returnState. Variants and snapshots: desktop/narrow, initial/continued month, all/current/historical scope, large result set, search/filter intersection.",
