                      "name": "Delivery / Mobile history filters",
                      "context": "\nScoped component contract [updates-following-email]. Preserve source operation state and callback scope. Modal traps focus, restores opener; no sign-in replay. Close never cancels submitted work. Unknown checks original identity; only confirmed not-saved permits retry. Paused/globally-off values retain saved choices. Inputs: exact fixture copy, identity, timestamps, current permissions and action callbacks. Variants: explicit source states and descendant overrides. A11y: preserve reading order, accessible names, keyboard and focus restoration; status needs text, not color alone. Regression: preserve source bounds, hidden parts, defaults, unknown-outcome recovery and all nested refs.",
