                      "name": "Following / Delivery history",
                      "context": "One row per delivery batch and channel. Activate an event title to open EKrDd for that exact delivery. Preserve outcome, destination and batch identity; no automatic resend.\nScoped component contract [updates-following-email]. Inputs: followId, canonical eventId or deliveryId, permissions, inherited defaults, requested and effective channels, batch identity and source timestamps. Pause stops app-controlled sends, not handed-off messages. History keeps one row per batch/channel; attempts stay nested. Unknown outcome is reconciled, never replayed. Inputs: exact fixture copy, identity, timestamps, current permissions and action callbacks. Variants: explicit source states and descendant overrides. A11y: preserve reading order, accessible names, keyboard and focus restoration; status needs text, not color alone. Regression: preserve source bounds, hidden parts, defaults, unknown-outcome recovery and all nested refs.",
