                      "id": "XFcMq",
                      "name": "Following / Matched events",
                      "context": "Retained canonical matched events. Source occurrence dates, not delivery attempts. Opening evidence and returning restores this panel and its pagination. No claim that matching continues while paused.\nScoped component contract [updates-following-email]. Inputs: followId, canonical eventId or deliveryId, permissions, inherited defaults, requested and effective channels, batch identity and source timestamps. Pause stops app-controlled sends, not handed-off messages. History keeps one row per batch/channel; attempts stay nested. Unknown outcome is reconciled, never replayed. Inputs: exact fixture copy, identity, timestamps, current permissions and action callbacks. Variants: explicit source states and descendant overrides. A11y: preserve reading order, accessible names, keyboard and focus restoration; status needs text, not color alone. Regression: preserve source bounds, hidden parts, defaults, unknown-outcome recovery and all nested refs.",
