                      "context": "One row per delivery batch and channel. Activate an event title to open EKrDd for that exact delivery. Preserve outcome, destination and batch identity; no automatic resend.\nScoped component contract [updates-following-email]. Inputs: exact follow, event and batch/channel identities, page/filter, permissions and effective preferences. Pause retains historical events; matching/backfill remains gated. Outcomes pending, accepted, suppressed, failed and unknown remain distinct. Attempts do not create event rows. Inputs: exact fixture copy, identity, timestamps, current permissions and action callbacks. Variants: explicit source states and descendant overrides. A11y: preserve reading order, accessible names, keyboard and focus restoration; status needs text, not color alone. Regression: preserve source bounds, hidden parts, defaults, unknown-outcome recovery and all nested refs.",
