                      "content": "Cover bills, amendments, representatives, committees and mixed records. Test first, middle and last pages; unknown totals; long titles and large counts; loading, retry and expired snapshots; no results and access loss. An unavailable record must not reveal a revoked private title. These are design fixtures, not executable interaction tests.",
