              "content": "Use the message’s stored timestamp, not “now” on every render. User messages show their sent/accepted time; assistant messages use their response-start time, stable through streaming. A clarification has an asked time and a separate accepted-reply time. Dates in source records, research duration and chat times remain different facts. Unknown or unconfirmed times are never fabricated.",
